{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If find object, then approach, take, check weight and destination, do specific task, or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = isObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />",
